{{ 's-p-policies.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div class="p">
  <h1>Returns, Shipping & Store Policies</h1>
  <p>
    At The Living Set, we want you to love everything you bring into your home. All of our policies are designed for a
    smooth shopping experience while fully complying with Egyptian Consumer Protection Law No. 181 of 2018.
  </p>

  {% comment %} RETURNS {% endcomment %}

  <div class="policies">

    <div class="policy">
      <h3>1. Returns &amp; Exchanges (14-Day Guarantee)</h3>
      <p>
        Changed your mind? No problem. You may return or exchange any eligible item within 14 days of receiving your
        order—no reason required.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Condition: Items must be unused, unwashed, and in their original condition with all tags, packaging, and your
          receipt/invoice intact.
        </li>
        <li>Sale Items: Discounted or promotional items follow the exact same 14-day return and exchange policy.</li>
        <li>
          Exceptions: In accordance with Egyptian law, we cannot accept returns or exchanges (unless the item is
          defective) on:
          <ul>
            <li>Custom-made or made-to-order pieces tailored to your specific measurements or design choices.</li>
            <li>
              Unsealed hygiene-sensitive goods (such as opened bedding, pillows, or bath textiles) that cannot be
              restored to their original sealed condition.
            </li>
            <li>Items damaged due to misuse, improper care, or customer alteration.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="policy">
      <h3>2. Damaged, Defective, or Incorrect Items</h3>
      <p>We inspect every piece carefully before it leaves our studio.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Shipping Damage &amp; Missing Items: Please inspect your package upon arrival and contact us within 48 hours
          of delivery (with photos of the item and packaging) if anything arrived broken in transit or missing from your
          order so we can resolve it immediately.
        </li>
        <li>
          Manufacturing Defects (Statutory Guarantee): In accordance with Egyptian Consumer Protection Law, if a
          manufacturing defect appears or an item does not match its advertised specifications, you may request a free
          replacement or full refund within 30 days of delivery.
        </li>
        <li>
          Shipping Costs: The Living Set covers all return and replacement courier fees for verified defective, damaged,
          or incorrect orders.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="policy">
      <h3>3. How to Start a Return or Exchange</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>
          Reach Out: Message us on WhatsApp at [Insert Phone Number] or email [Insert Email] within the applicable
          timeframe with your order number and photos (if damaged or defective).
        </li>
        <li>
          Schedule Pickup: Our team will arrange a courier pickup right from your doorstep within [2–4] business days.
        </li>
        <li>
          Pack &amp; Hand Over: Place the item back in its original packaging alongside your invoice and hand it to the
          courier.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="policy">
      <h3>4. Refunds &amp; Order Cancellations</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Cancellations: You can cancel your order free of charge at any time before it is delivered.</li>
        <li>
          Refund Processing: Once your return reaches us and passes a quick quality check, your refund will be issued
          within 7 business days.
        </li>
        <li>
          Refund Method: Card and wallet payments are refunded to the original payment method. Cash on Delivery (COD)
          orders are refunded via bank transfer or Instapay/e-wallet.
        </li>
        <li>
          Shipping Fees: For standard change-of-mind returns, original delivery fees are non-refundable, and a return
          courier fee of [Insert Amount, e.g., 75 EGP] applies.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="policy">
      <h3>5. Shipping &amp; Delivery</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Cairo &amp; Giza: Delivered within [2–4] business days.</li>
        <li>Other Governorates: Delivered within [3–7] business days.</li>
        <li>
          Transparent Pricing: All prices listed on our website are in Egyptian Pounds (EGP) and include 14% VAT. Exact
          shipping costs are calculated and shown clearly at checkout before you pay.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="policy">
      <h3>6. Privacy &amp; Data Protection</h3>
      <p>
        Your privacy matters to us. In line with Egypt’s Personal Data Protection Law (Law No. 151 of 2020), we only
        collect the details needed to process and deliver your order (name, phone number, address, and email). We never
        sell or share your personal information with unauthorized third parties. You can request to view, update, or
        delete your data anytime at [Insert Email].
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

